OL,3,GNEWSA'My donated Brummie accent gives
OL,4,Ame confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who appealed for help to no
OL,7,Flonger sound like a "character from
OL,8,FStar Wars" due to his verbal dyspraxia
OL,9,Fsays he has found his calling.
OL,11,FChristian Wilson, 24, from Bromsgrove,
OL,12,Fuses 'text to speech' software in order
OL,13,Fto communicate but said he wanted to
OL,14,Fsound "like a man from Birmingham".
OL,16,FHis dream was made possible in 2024
OL,17,Fwhen he selected two voice donors that
OL,18,Fblended a Birmingham accent and a
OL,19,FWarwickshire accent, which he hoped
OL,20,Fwould help him sound more like his
OL,21,Ffather.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
