OL,3,GNEWSA'My donated Brummie accent gives
OL,4,Ame confidence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince May, Wilson has worked at
OL,7,FWorcestershire County Council as a SEND
OL,8,FPeer Advocate. He said his new dialect
OL,9,Fhad given him "the confidence to voice
OL,10,F[his] opinion".
